virt-manager-rust (generic tarball for x86_64 Linux)
====================================================

(Português abaixo.)

1:1 port of virt-manager 5.1.0 to Rust + GTK4. This tarball holds the usr/
tree in the same layout as the Python virt-manager and replaces it: remove
the distro's virt-manager/virtinst packages before installing.

The binaries were built on Ubuntu 24.04 and link dynamically against the
libraries below. On other distros, prefer the native package (.deb, .rpm,
Arch) when there is one.

Dependencies (Ubuntu/Debian names):
  libvirt0 libosinfo-1.0-0 libgtk-4-1 libgvnc-1.0-0
  libspice-client-glib-2.0-8 libvte-2.91-gtk4-0 libgtksourceview-5-0

Install:
  sudo cp -r usr/. /usr/
  sudo glib-compile-schemas /usr/share/glib-2.0/schemas
  sudo gtk-update-icon-cache -q -t -f /usr/share/icons/hicolor
  sudo update-desktop-database -q /usr/share/applications

Uninstall: delete the files listed by `tar tzf` in this tarball and run
the three commands above again.


virt-manager-rust (tarball genérico para x86_64 Linux)
======================================================

Porte 1:1 do virt-manager 5.1.0 para Rust + GTK4. Este tarball traz a
árvore usr/ no mesmo layout do virt-manager Python e o substitui: remova
os pacotes virt-manager/virtinst da distro antes de instalar.

Os binários foram compilados no Ubuntu 24.04 e linkam dinamicamente as
bibliotecas abaixo. Em outras distros, prefira o pacote próprio (.deb,
.rpm, Arch) quando houver.

Dependências (nomes do Ubuntu/Debian):
  libvirt0 libosinfo-1.0-0 libgtk-4-1 libgvnc-1.0-0
  libspice-client-glib-2.0-8 libvte-2.91-gtk4-0 libgtksourceview-5-0

Instalar:
  sudo cp -r usr/. /usr/
  sudo glib-compile-schemas /usr/share/glib-2.0/schemas
  sudo gtk-update-icon-cache -q -t -f /usr/share/icons/hicolor
  sudo update-desktop-database -q /usr/share/applications

Desinstalar: apague os arquivos listados por `tar tzf` neste tarball e
rode os três comandos acima de novo.
